WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.152
Cheap Groceries. Pay less for your weekly shop.

2
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:13.225
Same basket, four supermarkets. Mercadona, Alcampo, Dia and Carrefour never charge the same, week after week.

3
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:21.912
First, build your basket. Browse the aisles like in a real supermarket, or just type what you need, in English or in Spanish.

4
00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:35.829
Then compare the four shops side by side: the price, the nutrition, and what a gram of protein really costs. Click a shop to see the way there.

5
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:50.570
You walk home from university anyway, so a shop only costs you the detour on your way, plus the time you spend inside. Add your home address, and we count exactly that.

6
00:00:55.400 --> 00:01:02.668
Prefer delivery? See the delivery fee, and what each hour of your own time really costs you. Is it worth it? You decide.

7
00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:16.582
Save your basket and say how long it lasts. See your money and your time per day, per week, or per month. Tell us how long each product lasts you. The app never guesses.

8
00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:25.870
Cheap Groceries. Free, at cheap-groceries.vercel.app.

